          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "which formed an important part of his steam engine. His design used the concept behind another parallelogram-based device called a pantograph, which can make exact scaled copies of a drawing: search the internet for a video showing how a pantograph works. It is ingenious!"
            }
