            0.115,
            0.441,
            0.883,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Parallelograms also serve as a powerful tool within geometry. Let us illustrate this by using parallelograms in a clever way to prove an important fact about triangles. We will discover this fact through exploration."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
